  "final_text": "I fixed the bug in `activity/timeparse.py`, and the full test suite now passes (7 tests).\n\n**The bug:** `parse_12h` read \"12:xx AM\" as hour 12, which is noon, when it should be hour 0, just after midnight. Because of this, the events at \"12:10 AM\" and \"12:20 AM\" on March 2 were placed at midday instead of right after midnight. That opened a gap of more than 30 minutes, so the night session was split in two.\n\n**The fix:** I added a branch that sets the hour to 0 when the time is \"12\" and the suffix is AM. With that, the four night events form one 40-minute session, which is what the test expect"
